        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Hierro</strong> (\"iron skin\"). Your compressed reiryoku hardens your skin. You gain <strong>resistance to physical damage equal to half your level</strong> (minimum 1).</p><p><strong>Sonido</strong> (\"sound\"). You gain a <strong>+5-foot status bonus</strong> to all your Speeds. At 11th level this increases to +10 feet.</p><hr /><p><em>Hierro is broader than <em>Thermal Nimbus</em> — all physical rather than one energy type — at half the rate, and it arrives at 1st level on a class with light armour and 10 Hit Points.</em></p>"
        },
